# NovaSpend UI/UX

## Design ratio: 90% minimal / 10% glass

- **Default:** flat surfaces, generous whitespace, no decorative clutter.
- **Glass (sparingly):** use `GlassSurface` only for nav bars, bottom sheets, floating panels, or one hero element per screen — never on every card.
- Glass = subtle blur + low-opacity fill + thin border. No heavy gradients or neon.

## Native platform feel

- Prefer platform-adaptive widgets: `AdaptiveScaffold`, Material on Android, Cupertino on iOS where it matters (navigation, dialogs, switches).
- Respect platform safe areas and system fonts (SF Pro on iOS, Roboto on Android via theme).
- Use `Theme.of(context).platform` or `defaultTargetPlatform` — do not force iOS chrome on Android or vice versa.

## Tokens (use these, do not magic-number in widgets)

| Token | Location | Values |
|-------|----------|--------|
| Accent | `AppColors.accent` | Single green `#10B981` — only accent hue in the app |
| Surfaces | `AppColors.surface/card/neutralFill/border(brightness)` | Light/dark pairs — never hardcode one mode |
| Radius | `AppRadius` | `md` 16, `lg` 20, `xl` 24 |
| Spacing | `AppSpacing` | `xs` 4 … `xxl` 48 — charts/lists need `lg`+ padding |
| Motion | `AppMotion` | 200–350 ms, `Curves.easeOutCubic` |

Import from `lib/core/theme/`.

## Theme & dark mode (required)

Every screen/widget must work in **light and dark**. Resolve colors from theme tokens — never ship feature-local palettes or light-only hex.

```dart
final theme = Theme.of(context);
final brightness = theme.brightness;
final cs = theme.colorScheme;

// Text
color: cs.onSurface           // ink
color: cs.onSurfaceVariant    // muted labels

// Surfaces / chrome
color: AppColors.surface(brightness)
color: AppColors.card(brightness)
color: AppColors.neutralFill(brightness)
color: AppColors.border(brightness)   // fields, dividers, handles
```

**Rules:**

- Prefer `Theme.of(context).colorScheme` for text/icons; `AppColors.*(brightness)` for surfaces, fills, borders.
- Use brightness helpers (`surface`, `card`, `border`, `neutralFill`, `warningForeground` / `warningBackground`) — do **not** scatter `isDark ? AppColors.xLight : AppColors.xDark` when a helper exists.
- Do **not** add private `_SheetColors` / `_FooColors` with `Color(0xFF…)` in feature files. New semantic colors go in `lib/core/theme/app_colors.dart`.
- Do **not** use only `borderLight` / `neutralFillLight` / `surfaceLight` — always pick via brightness so dark mode is correct.
- `Colors.white` / `Colors.black` only as **on-primary** (glyph on `primaryStrong`/`accent` fills), shadows, or system overlays — never as page/sheet text or backgrounds.
- Status chips (warning/review): use `AppColors.warningForeground/Background(brightness)`, not inline amber hex.

## Icons

- Prefer custom SVGs in `assets/icons/` over Material/Cupertino icons for product UI (rows, CTAs, nav).
- Load with `SvgPicture.asset` + `ColorFilter.mode(color, BlendMode.srcIn)` so icons tint with theme/muted ink.
- Default size **20×20**; keep intrinsic aspect when the asset isn’t square (e.g. payment card 20×16).
- Register new assets under `flutter.assets` in `pubspec.yaml`.
- Categories stay in `assets/icons/categories/`; UI chrome icons use `icon_<name>.svg`.

## Layout patterns

### Bottom sheets

Canonical UI/UX: `date_range_sheet.dart` (Transactions date filter). Follow `.cursor/rules/novaspend-bottom-sheets.mdc` for shell, header/close, option rows, Clear/Apply footer, and expand motion.

### Large balance at top

- Primary screens (home, analytics) lead with `BalanceHeader`: large amount (`displayLarge` / 36–48 sp), muted label above, accent only on positive/trend indicators.
- Balance sits in top third; actions below, not competing with the number.

### Clean cards

- Use `AppCard` for list items and grouped content: white/dark surface, `AppRadius.lg`, soft shadow or 1 px border — no glass on standard cards.
- One concept per card; 16 px internal padding minimum.

### Detail info rows (label + value)

Use for metadata lists (bank, account, payment method, reference, etc.):

```
[icon 20] —12px— [label] —12px— [Expanded → value right-aligned]
padding: 16 all sides
```

- Label: 16 sp / w600 / height 1.5, muted, **single line** (`softWrap: false`).
- Value: 16 sp / w500 / height 1.5, ink; ellipsis if needed.
- Dividers between rows: 1 px at `AppColors.border(brightness)` ~30–35% opacity.
- Hide the whole row when the value is empty — don’t show placeholders.
- IDs/refs: monospace badge (muted fill via `AppColors.neutralFill(brightness)`, 4 px radius, horizontal padding 8).

### Primary pill CTA

Primary actions (e.g. Edit Transaction):

- `FilledButton.icon` — bg `AppColors.primaryStrong`, fg white, `AppRadius.pill`.
- SVG leading icon (~15 px), white tint; label 16 / w600 / 1.5.
- Padding ~horizontal 40 / vertical 12; `elevation: 0` on the button.
- Soft dual shadow on a wrapping `DecoratedBox` (black 10%: `0,2` blur 4 / `0,4` blur 6).
- Do not use outlined/spend-colored variants for this primary action.

### Charts

- Simple line/bar only; muted grid lines; accent color for primary series, grey for secondary.
- Minimum 24 px padding around chart; no 3D, no legend boxes unless necessary.
- Prefer `fl_chart` (when added) with minimal axis labels.

## Animations

- Page transitions: 300 ms ease-out.
- List insert/remove: `AnimatedList` or implicit `AnimatedSwitcher` (~250 ms).
- Balance/count updates: short scale or fade — never bounce or elastic on money values.
- Respect `MediaQuery.disableAnimations` / reduced motion.

## Color rules

- **One accent** (`AppColors.accent`) for CTAs, active nav, positive trends, chart primary series.
- Neutrals for text: `colorScheme.onSurface` / `onSurfaceVariant` (not hardcoded ink hex).
- Semantic colors (`AppColors.spend`, warning helpers) only for status — not decoration.
- Brand fills (`primaryStrong`, `accent`) are shared across themes; pair with white on-fill text.

## Do / Don't

| Do | Don't |
|----|-------|
| Whitespace between sections (`AppSpacing.lg`+) | Dense stacked cards |
| `context.l10n` for all copy | Hardcoded labels |
| Custom SVG icons + theme tint | Ad-hoc Material icons for product chrome |
| Icon + label + value info rows as above | Text-only meta rows or wrapping labels |
| `primaryStrong` pill CTA for primary edits | Outlined/spend-colored primary actions |
| Shared widgets in `core/widgets/` | Duplicate card styles per feature |
| Glass on ≤1 surface per screen | Full glassmorphism theme |
| `AppColors.*(brightness)` + `colorScheme` | Inline `Color(0xFF…)` or private `_SheetColors` in features |
| Borders/fills via `border`/`neutralFill` helpers | Light-only `borderLight` / `fieldFill` hex |
| New semantic colors in `app_colors.dart` | Feature-local light/dark hex pairs |

## File placement

- Design tokens: `lib/core/theme/`
- Reusable UI: `lib/core/widgets/` (`AppCard`, `GlassSurface`, `BalanceHeader`, `AdaptiveScaffold`)
- Product icons: `assets/icons/icon_*.svg` (categories under `assets/icons/categories/`)
- Feature-specific layouts: `features/<feature>/presentation/widgets/`
